# streams2 — reading back: XRANGE and XREVRANGE
#
# Learn: XRANGE key start end [COUNT n] reads entries oldest first; - and
# + mean the smallest and largest possible IDs. XREVRANGE key end start
# walks backwards (note the argument order: end comes first).
#
# Task: print the 2 NEWEST entries of events, newest first.
#

XRANGE events - + COUNT 2
